{\pard\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Verse 1\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Amazing grace how sweet the sound,\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut That saved a wretch like me;\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut I once was lost, but now am found\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Was blind, but now I see. \par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Verse 2\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut T'was grace that taught my heart to fear,\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut And grace my fears relieved;\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut How precious did that grace appear\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut The hour I first believed. \par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Verse 3\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Through many dangers, toil and snares,\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut I have already come;\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut 'Tis grace has brought me safe thus far,\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut And grace will lead me home. \par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Verse 4\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut When we've been there ten thousand years\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Bright shining as the sun,\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut We've no less days to sing God's praise\par
\li0\fi0\ri0\sb0\sl\sa0 \plain\f1\fntnamaut Than when we've first begun.}
}